"Every article translation written in this language is deleted, with its "
"history and comments. Articles that only exist in this language are deleted "
"too. This cannot be undone. To hide the language without losing anything, "
"disable it instead."
msgstr ""
"Toutes les traductions d'articles rédigées dans cette langue sont "
"supprimées, avec leur historique et leurs commentaires. Les articles qui "
